{
  "slug": "mongodb",
  "name": "Mongodb",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Official Claude plugin for MongoDB (MCP Server + Skills). Connect to databases, explore data, manage collections, optimize queries, generate reliable code, implement best practices, develop advanced features, and more.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **7 skills** and **1 MCP server**.\n\n- **Skills** (7): `mongodb-atlas-stream-processing` (Manages MongoDB Atlas Stream Processing (ASP) workflows), `mongodb-connection` (Optimize MongoDB client connection configuration (pools, timeouts, patterns) for any supported driver language), `mongodb-mcp-setup` (Guide users through configuring key MongoDB MCP server options), `mongodb-natural-language-querying` (Generate read-only MongoDB queries (find) or aggregation pipelines using natural language, with collection schema context and sample documents), `mongodb-query-optimizer` (Help with MongoDB query optimization and indexing), `mongodb-schema-design` (MongoDB schema design patterns and anti-patterns), `mongodb-search-and-ai` (Guides MongoDB users through implementing and optimizing Atlas Search (full-text), Vector Search (semantic), and Hybrid Search solutions)\n- **MCP servers** (1): `mongodb`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install mongodb@claude-plugins-official` from `mongodb/agent-skills` (`plugins/mongodb`).",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude",
    "copilot",
    "codex"
  ],
  "pluginType": "package",
  "package": {
    "skill": 7,
    "mcp": 1
  },
